}

⟦Γ:Rules⟧{
  ∀x∈α:x≥0
  ∀x∈β:x.length>0
  ∀x,y∈α:x≤y⇒f(x)≤f(y)
  ∃x∈α:x≡0
  ∀R∈R:R.a>0⇒R.c≡⊤
